{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize and build your own car! This hardcore automotive game requires basic car knowledge, allowing highly free adjustment of performance parameters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meanwhile, design your vehicle\u2019s appearance with voxel-based modular building blocks for limitless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pre-made templates are provided for inspiration if you need guidance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, create a completely unique car to conquer race tracks and off-road challenges! Compete online with friends and showcase your engineering masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(This game is independently developed by a solo creator pursuing a game-design dream. Overcoming countless challenges from programming, 3D modeling, to technical art \u2013 every aspect was self-taught from scratch. Your support is greatly appreciated!)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581680?t=1749092399","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/83f58d9fe96d711b0d294d286f3d21686c2cefc8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749092399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/cb3baafbe1cc012a2b5ce116cc09191d66f941f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749092399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/cb3baafbe1cc012a2b5ce116cc09191d66f941f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749092399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize and build your own car! This hardcore automotive game requires basic car knowledge, allowing highly free adjustment of performance parameters!</p><p class=\"bb